          "en": "Founded in 2021 in Xikou Township, Chiayi by Chen Wu-tong to revitalize his hometown, Lunwo Social Enterprise promotes high-value asparagus cultivation to counter low returns in traditional farming and develops asparagus-processed foods to add value, reduce waste and build a circular economy. It introduces smart-agriculture environmental-control greenhouses and directs profits to rural economy, environmental protection, community development, education/culture and social care.",
